{
    "pr_body": "- Fix https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/114845\r\n- **More importantly!** Fix EsqlNodeSubclassTests _so that they also test the Node subclasses in esql.core._\r\n\r\nDue to a subtle mistake when copying the ql project into esql.core, the EsqlNodeSubclassTests did not run on subclasses in esql.core _at all_. This adds a fix to EsqlNodeSubclassTests.subclassesOf.\r\n\r\nThe classes ReferenceAttribute, FieldAttribute and MetadataAttribute did not respect the contract for Node.info because their info method did not use the longest public constructor - this is https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/114845. This is fixed here as well.",
